  "text": "Veterinary Cancer & Surgery Specialists\n503-908-1492\ninfo@vcsspdx.com\nFacebook\nInstagram\nFacebook\nInstagram\nHome\nAbout\nOur Philosophy\nOur Team\nHospital Tour\nFeatured Pets\nCelebration of Life\nReviews\nCareers\nServices\nOncology\nOncology Overview\nWhat Is A Veterinary Oncologist?\nPhaSeal® System\nElectrochemotherapy\nSurgery\nSurgery Overview\nProcedures Offered\nAnesthesia & Pain Management\nElectrochemotherapy\nResources\nLocal Emergency Veterinary Clinics\nMassage Therapy\nThe Argus Institute Counseling And Support Services\nAnimal Cancer Research Documentary\nGenomics\nIn-Home Euthanasia Services\nClient Center\nFAQs\nHome Safety for Pet Owners & Patients Receiving Anti-Cancer Medications\nHome Prescription Delivery\nWellevate: Nutritional Supplements\nPayment Options\nOnline Forms\nNew Client Form\nContact\nFor Pet Owners\nFor Referring Veterinarians\nSubmit a Referral\nRequest Print Materials\nCall Us\nSelect Page\nFounded in 2014\nFounded in 2014\nOregon’s\ncancer and surgery animal hospital.\nOregon’s first\nlocally and privately owned cancer and surgery animal hospital\nCall For An Appointment\nWelcome to\nVeterinary Cancer & Surgery Specialists\nVeterinary Cancer & Surgery Specialists\nwas created in 2014 to provide a warm, caring, and compassionate environment for you and your pet. We are proud to offer our expertise in\nadvanced surgery\nand\ncancer care\n, with hope and healing. We always strive to treat our patients the same way we would treat our own pets.\nMore About Us\nOur\nVeterinary Services\nin Milwaukie, OR\nWe dedicate an extraordinarily high level of attention to the individual dogs and cats we treat and always strive to make your difficult decisions regarding your pet a little easier.\nOncology\nDetails\nSurgery\nDetails\nClinical Trials\nDetails\nGet to know our\nveterinary team\nYou shouldn’t settle for anything less than the absolute best care for your pet. Our\nexperienced vet team\nis here to help.\nMeet Our Team\nDr. Kim Freeman, DVM, DACVIM (Oncology)\nDr. John Wooldridge, DVM, DACVS\nDR. SUSIE KANG, DVM, DACVIM (Oncology)\nDr. Ross Luethcke, PhD, DVM, DACVIM (Oncology)\n“Such a kind and caring collection of people! It wasn’t great circumstances that brought us to see them, but they’ve all worked together to make my family feel exceptionally well cared for.”\nDaniel F.\nMore Reviews\nRecovery Starts Here\nWe proudly bring our compassionate veterinary care to the pets of Oregon and Southern Washington. Easily request an appointment for your pet by simply\ngiving us a call.\nAppointment\n\nFind Us\n10400 SE Main St\nMilwaukie, OR 97222\n\nOur Hours\nMon–Thu: 8:00am–5:30pm\nFri: 8:00am–5:00pm\nSat & Sun: Closed\n\nContact Us\nCall us:\n503-908-1492\nEmail us:\ninfo@vcsspdx.com\nText us:\n503-908-4022\n© 2026 Veterinary Cancer & Surgery Specialists |\nPowered by PetDesk\nFollow\nFollow\n© 2026 Veterinary Cancer & Surgery Specialists |\nPowered by PetDesk\nFollow",
